  "details": "Run vrchat in desktop, stay on for an hour or so.\n\nAfter enough time has passed, moving camera around or the mouse across the screen causes stutter.\n\nThis happens both on my desktop and my laptop, restarting completely solves the issue, until you have been in game for long enough for it to happen again.\n\nThe issue does not seem to happen in VR at all, ony in desktop mode.\n\nI've attatched a printout from dxdiag if you need to know anything about my HW\n\nMy laptop runs a 7735HS with a RX 7600S, but it also seems to happen with the Igpu\n\nThe build number is on my desktop, but my laptop runs the non beta build, and the issue has been presistent for a while.",
